        <mxCell id="note" value="There is no SLOT entity, and that absence is the design. A bookable slot is derived: schedule MINUS leave MINUS booked appointments. schedule and leave are both WEAK entities — a weekly clinic has no identity apart from the doctor whose clinic it is." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#47606D;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D3DEE3;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="1570" width="820" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
